        <activityName xml:lang="en">Core board, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Core board, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of core board, as produced in a modern core board mill;
UUID: 182f2859-46b2-3c11-adb2-89c9a4c8f77d
Material input, water (cooling &amp; process) consumption, energy consumption, emissions to air and water. Estimations for transports and infrastructure. No waste reported.
Location: Data based on one finnish plant from Corenso Ltd. Representing here average European data.
Technology: presently used technology in a modern plant in Finnland
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Examined mill 102 kt - company total 300 kt (3 mills)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_182f2859-46b2-3c11-adb2-89c9a4c8f77d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
